# python tools/false_verdict_probe.py — 2026-08-11 17:17:06 AEST
# python Python 3.9.6

判定可靠性探针 — wm_kit
目标：找出 Judge 会给出虚假判定（false positive / false negative）的路径


==============================================================================
[A] 身份漂移：判定用的 target.after 和 target.before 不是同一个对象
==============================================================================
  动作前：
  before:
    ball_001     name=ball    conf=0.950 state=confirmed pos=(+0.143,+1.165) age=0.0s
    basket_002   name=basket  conf=0.920 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=0.0s
  after:
    ball_001     name=ball    conf=0.377 state=stale     pos=(+0.143,+1.165) age=2.0s
    basket_002   name=basket  conf=0.927 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=0.0s
    ball_003     name=ball    conf=0.880 state=tentative pos=(-0.580,+1.610) age=0.0s
  success = True
  detail  = ball 距 basket 2.24cm，阈值 15.0cm
  relation      = {'type': 'inside', 'distance_cm': 2.24, 'threshold_cm': 15.0, 'satisfied': True}
  target.before = ball_001
  target.after  = ball_003
  staleness_s   = 0.0
  warnings      = []

  物理事实：球确实进桶了 -> 应 success=True
  系统输出：success=True，但 before/after 是两个不同 obj_id，
            老轨迹 ball_001 仍以 STALE 留在快照里，判定靠 _find 取 max(confidence) 抽中了新轨迹。

>>> 结论 [A] FRAGILE —— 结论对，但对的原因是置信度竞赛而非物理；无任何 warning 提示身份已切换

==============================================================================
[B] 同一物理事实，只把新检测置信度调低 -> 判定翻转
==============================================================================

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  新检测 confidence = 0.88（球都在桶里，物理事实不变）
  after:
    ball_001     name=ball    conf=0.598 state=confirmed pos=(+0.143,+1.165) age=1.0s
    basket_002   name=basket  conf=0.927 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=0.0s
    ball_003     name=ball    conf=0.880 state=tentative pos=(-0.580,+1.610) age=0.0s
  _find 选中 = ball_003（取 max(confidence)）
  success = True | detail = ball 距 basket 2.24cm，阈值 15.0cm

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  新检测 confidence = 0.55（球都在桶里，物理事实不变）
  after:
    ball_001     name=ball    conf=0.598 state=confirmed pos=(+0.143,+1.165) age=1.0s
    basket_002   name=basket  conf=0.927 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=0.0s
    ball_003     name=ball    conf=0.550 state=tentative pos=(-0.580,+1.610) age=0.0s
  _find 选中 = ball_001（取 max(confidence)）
  success = False | detail = ball 距 basket 86.1cm，阈值 15.0cm

  两次物理事实完全相同（球在桶里），只是桶里的球被桶壁挡住一部分，
  检测分数从 0.88 掉到 0.55，低于幽灵轨迹 ball_001 衰减后的 0.598；
  _find 改抽中留在原位的 ball_001，判定随之翻转。

>>> 结论 [B] FALSE NEGATIVE —— 球已进桶却判失败：判定结果由两条轨迹的置信度大小决定（0.88->ball_003 success=True，0.55->ball_001 success=False）

