==============================================================================
[D] before 是摆设：动作前后完全相同的快照，照样判成功
==============================================================================
  before:
    ball_900     name=ball    conf=0.900 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=0.0s
    basket_901   name=basket  conf=0.920 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=0.0s
  after :
    ball_900     name=ball    conf=0.900 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=0.0s
    basket_901   name=basket  conf=0.920 state=confirmed pos=(-0.600,+1.600) age=0.0s
  success = True
  detail  = ball 距 basket 0.0cm，阈值 15.0cm
  relation      = {'type': 'inside', 'distance_cm': 0.0, 'threshold_cm': 15.0, 'satisfied': True}
  target.before = ball_900
  target.after  = ball_900
  staleness_s   = 0.0
  warnings      = []

  物理事实：球在动作前就已经在桶里，本次动作什么也没发生（甚至可以是空动作）。
  verdict_basis 自称 'world_model_diff'，但 build_containment_evidence 只读 after，
  before 仅被塞进 evidence 展示，从未参与 satisfied 的计算。

>>> 结论 [D] FALSE POSITIVE —— 无差分要求：把'状态已满足'当成'动作已成功'，空动作也能拿到 success=True

==============================================================================
[E] 陈旧度护栏被默认值关掉：now=0.0（JudgeRequest 默认）时永远不触发
==============================================================================

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  正确传 now=130.0（证据已 30 秒未刷新）:
  success = False
  detail  = ball 距 basket 0.0cm，阈值 15.0cm
  relation      = {'type': 'inside', 'distance_cm': 0.0, 'threshold_cm': 15.0, 'satisfied': True}
  target.before = None
  target.after  = ball_900
  staleness_s   = 30.0
  warnings      = ['证据陈旧 30.00s，视觉确认不可靠']

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  调用方忘了传 now（JudgeRequest.now 默认 0.0）:
  success = True
  detail  = ball 距 basket 0.0cm，阈值 15.0cm
  relation      = {'type': 'inside', 'distance_cm': 0.0, 'threshold_cm': 15.0, 'satisfied': True}
  target.before = None
  target.after  = ball_900
  staleness_s   = 0.0
  warnings      = []

  age() 里的 max(0.0, now - last_seen) 把负数夹成 0，时钟不一致/漏传 now 时
  staleness 恒为 0.0，既不报警也不影响判定 —— 护栏静默失效，无任何提示。

>>> 结论 [E] FALSE POSITIVE —— 30 秒前的陈旧快照被当作实时视觉确认，success 从 False 翻成 True

